Description: A command-line tool that monitors a program's resource usage and generates an HTCondor submit file. 
 A command-line tool that monitors a program's resource usage and generates an HTCondor submit file. Designed for NMRbox users who want to run jobs on the HTCondor pool without writing submit files by hand.
